<h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
<p class="updated">Last updated: 5 November 2026</p>

<p>Welcome to Black Rabbit. These terms cover your use of this website and your visit to our bar. By using the site or sending us a table request, you agree to them. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.</p>

<h2>1. Who we are</h2>
<p>Black Rabbit is a women-owned rooftop bar at Basic Mall Statehouse, Nakuru, Kenya. In these terms, "we", "us" and "our" mean Black Rabbit. You can reach us at <a href="mailto:navajkerrie@gmail.com">navajkerrie@gmail.com</a> or +254 712 364 610.</p>

<h2>2. Table requests and reservations</h2>
<ul>
<li>Sending the reservation form is a request, not a guaranteed booking. Your table is only reserved once we confirm it by email or WhatsApp.</li>
<li>Please give accurate details, including the number of guests. If your plans change, tell us as early as you can.</li>
<li>We hold tables for 15 minutes after the booked time. After that we may give your table to other guests.</li>
<li>Seating preferences (inside or rooftop) are requests. We will do our best but can't always guarantee them, especially in bad weather or at busy times.</li>
<li>For large groups, private hire or special occasions, we may ask for extra details or a deposit. We will tell you before you confirm. See our <a href="refund.html">Booking and Refund Policy</a>.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Age and responsible drinking</h2>
<ul>
<li>You must be 18 or over to buy or drink alcohol at Black Rabbit. We may ask for ID and can refuse service if we are not satisfied.</li>
<li>We serve alcohol responsibly. We may refuse or stop service to anyone who seems intoxicated, and may ask guests to leave if they put themselves or others at risk.</li>
<li>Please don't drink and drive. Ask our team to help you arrange a safe ride home.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. House rules</h2>
<ul>
<li>Treat our team and other guests with respect. Harassment, discrimination, aggression and unwanted attention are not tolerated, and we may ask you to leave without refund.</li>
<li>Illegal drugs and weapons are not allowed on the premises.</li>
<li>Quiz nights, bar games and other events may change, move or be cancelled. We will try to give notice through our usual channels.</li>
<li>You are responsible for damage you or your group cause to our property.</li>
<li>We keep a safe, welcoming space for everyone. If you need any access support, tell us when you book and we will do our best to help.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Prices and payment</h2>
<p>Menu items, happy-hour offers and prices can change without notice. Prices at the bar are the ones that apply when you order. Payment is accepted by the methods shown at the venue, which currently include credit and debit cards.</p>

