<li>Use the site only for lawful purposes, and don't try to disrupt it, copy it in bulk, or send false or harmful submissions through our forms.</li>
<li>We try to keep opening hours, offers and other information accurate, but we can't promise it is always complete or current. Please confirm important details with us directly.</li>
